---
import { products, formatPrice } from '../data/products';
const mixes = ['mix-standart', 'winter-assortment'].map((id) => {
  const product = products.find((item) => item.id === id);
  if (!product) throw new Error(`Missing mix product: ${id}`);
  return product;
});
---
<section class="mix-comparison" aria-labelledby="mix-comparison-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="mix-comparison-title">Który mix pasuje do Twojego sklepu?</h2>
    <div class="comparison-table">
      <table>
        <caption class="sr-only">Porównanie Mix Standart i Winter Assortment</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Porównanie</th>{mixes.map((product) => <th scope="col">{product.name}</th>)}</tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Zastosowanie</th><td>Uzupełnienie różnych działów sklepu</td><td>Oferta na chłodniejsze miesiące</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Jakość według katalogu</th>{mixes.map((product) => <td>{product.quality.pl}</td>)}</tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Cena netto za kg</th>{mixes.map((product) => <td>{formatPrice(product.netPricePlnPerKg, 'pl')} zł</td>)}</tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Minimum jednej pozycji</th>{mixes.map(() => <td>50 kg</td>)}</tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Koszt minimum netto</th>{mixes.map((product) => <td><strong>{formatPrice(product.netPricePlnPerKg * 50, 'pl')} zł</strong></td>)}</tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>VAT i transport doliczamy osobno. Skład, stan, cenę i dostępność potwierdzamy dla konkretnej partii. Zamówienie obu miksów to minimum 100 kg — po 50 kg każdej pozycji.</p>
    <div class="mix-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontakt" data-inquire-product="mix-standart">Zapytaj o Mix Standart →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#kontakt" data-inquire-product="winter-assortment">Zapytaj o mix zimowy →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  .mix-comparison { padding-block: 32px 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--text-strong); font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 30px); font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.3; text-wrap: pretty; }
  table { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; }
  th, td { padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  thead { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text-strong); }
  tbody th { color: var(--text-soft); font-weight: 500; }
  td { color: var(--text-strong); }
  p { margin: 20px 0; max-width: 80ch; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .mix-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 20px; white-space: normal; }
  @media (max-width: 599px) { table { font-size: 12px; } th, td { padding: 12px 8px; } .mix-actions .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; } }
</style>
